WEBVTT

00:25:00.009 --> 00:25:06.263
and the magnetic ideas of right and left
that have helped drive that,

00:25:06.287 --> 00:25:09.742
and that possibly, this idea
of the neighborhood

00:25:09.766 --> 00:25:13.234
could become a magnetic idea
that draws people to the center.

00:25:13.258 --> 00:25:15.078
Talk. Make that thesis.

00:25:15.102 --> 00:25:17.667
DB: Well, we're engulfed
in tribalism right now,

00:25:17.691 --> 00:25:19.507
and so where does that come from?

00:25:19.531 --> 00:25:21.499
And it's all over the world, by the way.

00:25:21.523 --> 00:25:24.284
In my view, if you leave
human beings naked and alone,

00:25:24.308 --> 00:25:26.791
which we've done in a culture
of hyperindividualism,

00:25:26.815 --> 00:25:29.365
they do what their evolutionary
roots tell them to do:

00:25:29.389 --> 00:25:30.540
they revert to tribe.